1
00:00:39,828 --> 00:00:45,632
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,099 --> 00:00:48,736
=Episode 20=

3
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,159
My power is fading.

4
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,200
Do you know why?

5
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,680
Do you remember

6
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:54,680
when we came to this mortal realm,

7
00:01:57,799 --> 00:01:59,519
and why we stayed here?

8
00:02:00,719 --> 00:02:01,599
A thousand years ago,

9
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:03,359
the Cloud Steps opened,

10
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:06,120
and we came to control the floods,

11
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,000
but an incident occurred.

12
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,199
Greedy mortals

13
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,199
sought to take my scales.

14
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,759
Your Li Fire ran wild,

15
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,080
blocking you from the Cloud Steps.

16
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:20,319
So our kin sealed you beneath the abyss

17
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:21,879
to suppress the Li Fire.

18
00:02:23,199 --> 00:02:24,439
Do you know why that seal

19
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:26,759
cast you into slumber?

20
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:32,199
The spiritual energy in this realm

21
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:33,680
is thin and polluted,

22
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:36,319
conflicting with your nature.

23
00:02:37,039 --> 00:02:38,400
Had you not slumbered,

24
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:40,360
the foul energy would have tainted you.

25
00:02:41,159 --> 00:02:41,879
Originally,

26
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,240
the seal could protect you

27
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,199
until the Cloud Steps opened again

28
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,719
at the right time

29
00:02:48,159 --> 00:02:49,719
for you to awaken and return home.

30
00:02:50,159 --> 00:02:50,759
Unexpectedly,

31
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,360
she entered the Loong Abyss.

32
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:54,919
Her blood

33
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,560
(accidentally absorbed the seal,)

34
00:02:57,919 --> 00:02:59,120
(allowing you to awaken.)

35
00:02:59,759 --> 00:03:01,919
(You crave her company and intimacy)

36
00:03:02,879 --> 00:03:04,680
(because she absorbed the seal.)

37
00:03:05,439 --> 00:03:06,240
(Only she)

38
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:09,039
(can soothe your burning pain.)

39
00:03:10,719 --> 00:03:12,120
She temporarily became your anchor

40
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,719
in this mortal realm.

41
00:03:16,199 --> 00:03:17,719
Yet the foul energy of this world

42
00:03:18,159 --> 00:03:19,599
will eventually taint you.

43
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,199
Fortunately,

44
00:03:22,199 --> 00:03:24,759
the Cloud Steps will open again soon.

45
00:03:25,719 --> 00:03:28,360
It is the loong's millennium return,

46
00:03:29,919 --> 00:03:32,479
and our only chance to leave this realm.

47
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:34,319
What if

48
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:36,400
I don't go back?

49
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,960
Tainted by the foul energy,

50
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:41,960
you will turn to dust.

51
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:43,919
And her?

52
00:03:45,759 --> 00:03:46,759
Can she return with me?

53
00:03:47,439 --> 00:03:48,520
Immortal beings

54
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:51,120
cannot endure the foul energy here,

55
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,599
and mortal beings

56
00:03:53,919 --> 00:03:56,680
cannot survive our realm's pure energy.

57
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,759
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

58
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:02,759
You looked happy

59
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:05,319
with Lady Wangshu,

60
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,400
and I even proposed a marriage
on your behalf.

61
00:04:08,719 --> 00:04:09,840
I couldn't bear to spoil it.

62
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:12,439
Clinging to foolish hope,

63
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:16,120
I didn't tell you the whole truth.

64
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,120
It was my fault.

65
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,680
Anyway, My Lord,

66
00:04:21,199 --> 00:04:22,800
as pleasant as the mortal realm is,

67
00:04:23,439 --> 00:04:25,519
it is no place for us to stay.

68
00:04:28,639 --> 00:04:29,439
Listen,

69
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,639
I won't leave.

70
00:04:37,839 --> 00:04:39,000
I kept it from you

71
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,639
out of fear that, once you knew,

72
00:04:40,639 --> 00:04:41,920
you would stay away from her,

73
00:04:42,399 --> 00:04:43,959
thinking you might hurt her

74
00:04:44,399 --> 00:04:46,600
or let her grow even more attached.

75
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,639
Yet now,

76
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:51,279
I fear even more that you will stay

77
00:04:52,639 --> 00:04:53,879
for her sake.

78
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:57,839
So,

79
00:04:59,519 --> 00:05:00,959
I'm the one holding you back?

80
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,519
Why are you here?

81
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,920
I didn't even notice you.

82
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:11,839
You concealed her presence,

83
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:12,360
didn't you?

84
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:15,319
Knowing you would insist on hiding it,

85
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:18,279
and that Lady Wangshu had her doubts,

86
00:05:20,199 --> 00:05:21,279
I used a secret art

87
00:05:21,639 --> 00:05:23,600
so she could know the whole truth.

88
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,000
Lately,

89
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,560
your power has been fading.

90
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:46,240
How could I not notice?

91
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:47,959
I talked to Lanyuan earlier.

92
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,720
He refused to be frank,

93
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:52,600
but let me hide there.

94
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,120
Lizhi,

95
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,759
I never imagined

96
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,800
I'd become the shackles
holding you back.

97
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,560
When will the Cloud Steps

98
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:12,959
open again?

99
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,560
Anywhere you want to go?

100
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,360
I'll take you. Let's go.

101
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,240
Lanyuan made it very clear.

102
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:26,319
You must suppress your power here.

103
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,560
The longer you stay,

104
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:29,079
the weaker your power gets.

105
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:30,439
You can't stay any longer.

106
00:06:31,319 --> 00:06:33,439
I can't just watch you die!

107
00:06:33,839 --> 00:06:35,279
Let's revisit the imperial palace.

108
00:06:35,759 --> 00:06:36,399
The Eastern Sea?

109
00:06:37,959 --> 00:06:38,920
Or maybe Yunzhong?

110
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:39,959
The Eastern Sea.

111
00:06:39,959 --> 00:06:41,160
Lizhi, you can't do this.

112
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,600
Listen to me.

113
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,120
Go back first.

114
00:06:50,959 --> 00:06:52,120
You're so powerful.

115
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:55,399
I believe

116
00:07:00,319 --> 00:07:02,480
you'll find a way for both of us.

117
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:12,600
Wangshu,

118
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:14,959
I promised you

119
00:07:15,959 --> 00:07:17,319
I'd be with you your whole life.

120
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,040
I will surely

121
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,519
do what I've promised.

122
00:07:21,959 --> 00:07:23,000
As a person...

123
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,480
No,

124
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:27,399
as a loong,

125
00:07:28,639 --> 00:07:29,439
I'm greedy.

126
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,000
Beyond this life,

127
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,639
I want to be with you

128
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:38,879
in every lifetime.

129
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,439
In our next life,

130
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,560
if you don't remember me,

131
00:07:48,759 --> 00:07:49,560
I'll find you.

132
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,240
I'll make you love me again.

133
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:04,680
Your Highness,

134
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,680
Zhang Fan confessed.

135
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,399
The Yue sisters, along with His Majesty,

136
00:08:07,519 --> 00:08:08,639
have uncovered the truth.

137
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,560
His Majesty has grown up.

138
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:13,639
He dares openly turn against me now.

139
00:08:13,639 --> 00:08:15,680
Whether he knows the truth or not,

140
00:08:15,959 --> 00:08:17,199
what difference does it make?

141
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:20,600
What interests me right now

142
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:22,839
is the Loong Lord.

143
00:08:22,959 --> 00:08:24,480
He hasn't displayed

144
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:26,800
any earth-shattering magic.

145
00:08:26,959 --> 00:08:28,360
He merely worked with His Majesty

146
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,839
to subdue my men

147
00:08:30,199 --> 00:08:31,519
by force.

148
00:08:31,959 --> 00:08:33,200
Their methods are efficient.

149
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,240
If that loong

150
00:08:35,879 --> 00:08:37,919
could truly do whatever he wants,

151
00:08:38,399 --> 00:08:39,639
he would have

152
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,200
crushed every threat,

153
00:08:41,519 --> 00:08:43,080
like stepping on ants,

154
00:08:43,639 --> 00:08:45,080
and wiped them all out.

155
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:48,240
It seems

156
00:08:48,799 --> 00:08:50,000
I guessed right.

157
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:54,000
Your Majesty,

158
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:56,039
you didn't expect this, did you?

159
00:08:56,279 --> 00:08:58,159
While you were busy
investigating the case,

160
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:01,399
I had already sent men

161
00:09:01,679 --> 00:09:03,639
to thoroughly look into your trump card.

162
00:09:08,559 --> 00:09:09,240
Your Highness.

163
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,279
You may leave.

164
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,440
Yes, Your Highness.

165
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:14,639
Sit.

166
00:09:18,639 --> 00:09:20,240
So, what did you find?

167
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:22,039
Not long after the ritual,

168
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:24,559
Wangshu returned with that strange man.

169
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,480
Zhang Jin's servants claimed

170
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:29,720
they saw an immortal and a loong

171
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:30,559
being sold off.

172
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:33,200
Everyone thought it was nonsense,

173
00:09:33,559 --> 00:09:34,559
but looking back,

174
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,440
the clues were all there.

175
00:09:36,639 --> 00:09:37,840
We tracked them down.

176
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:38,840
They said

177
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:40,000
they saw a woman

178
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:42,919
appearing on the back of a loong.

179
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:43,919
Afterward,

180
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:45,840
they stayed at the thatched cottage.

181
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,240
The loong didn't hide his tracks.

182
00:09:48,559 --> 00:09:50,480
Many people saw him in the market

183
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:51,759
and went with him

184
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,879
to the cottage to get paid.

185
00:09:54,639 --> 00:09:55,440
Then he

186
00:09:55,879 --> 00:09:56,840
ran into your son.

187
00:09:57,519 --> 00:09:59,120
When your son went to see Yue Wangshu,

188
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,559
the loong drove him away.

189
00:10:02,399 --> 00:10:04,799
Later, the loong went
to Chunfeng Pavilion

190
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:08,440
and saved His Majesty
when he was lying low in plain clothes.

191
00:10:14,039 --> 00:10:14,759
I believe now

192
00:10:14,759 --> 00:10:15,919
the loong truly exists.

193
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:18,360
Yet I'm even more curious.

194
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,320
If he has such magic power,

195
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,200
why didn't he cut all loose ends?

196
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:25,519
Tell me. What is his weakness?

197
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,320
Most records on the loong are rumors,

198
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:31,080
yet one claims
a loong suffers a fire tribulation,

199
00:10:31,279 --> 00:10:32,679
and a water-natured woman can help.

200
00:10:33,679 --> 00:10:34,960
Right at Chunfeng Pavilion,

201
00:10:35,159 --> 00:10:38,840
he kissed Yue Wangshu before the crowd.

202
00:10:39,799 --> 00:10:40,840
Eyewitnesses said

203
00:10:41,559 --> 00:10:43,120
he appeared to be in great pain.

204
00:10:43,639 --> 00:10:44,879
That day at the execution site,

205
00:10:45,039 --> 00:10:47,799
he struck down dozens of soldiers
instantly.

206
00:10:48,519 --> 00:10:49,559
Most importantly,

207
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:53,720
black and red flames erupted around him.

208
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:54,879
He looked insane

209
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:57,080
and nearly burned the camp to ash.

210
00:10:57,759 --> 00:10:58,720
Yet Yue Wangshu's kiss

211
00:10:59,159 --> 00:10:59,799
calmed him down

212
00:11:00,799 --> 00:11:02,159
right away.

213
00:11:02,919 --> 00:11:03,799
It seems

214
00:11:04,039 --> 00:11:06,399
if we can capture Yue Wangshu,

215
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:08,840
this loong will be no threat.

216
00:11:12,159 --> 00:11:12,759
Ready the carriage.

217
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,639
I leave for the capital at once.

218
00:11:27,919 --> 00:11:29,320
Lady Xingyao, are you still busy?

219
00:11:43,799 --> 00:11:44,600
Your Ma...

220
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,720
Master Wei Xun.

221
00:11:52,559 --> 00:11:53,960
What brought you here

222
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:55,360
today?

223
00:11:55,679 --> 00:11:56,320
Nothing much.

224
00:11:57,559 --> 00:11:58,279
I want to see you.

225
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:09,039
Lady Xingyao went
to a cosmetics shop. She dislikes...

226
00:12:14,279 --> 00:12:15,840
Master Lizhi gave this to me.

227
00:12:17,679 --> 00:12:20,159
What a total fool he is.

228
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,840
Why don't you write

229
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:26,480
about Master Lizhi,
who you deeply care about,

230
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,159
or about Wangshu?

231
00:12:29,039 --> 00:12:30,679
Why are you only guarded against me?

232
00:12:30,679 --> 00:12:31,399
Not like that.

233
00:12:39,679 --> 00:12:40,679
Lady Xingyao.

234
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:43,519
I came today

235
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:48,320
to bid you farewell.

236
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,200
It's an emergency.

237
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:52,679
Something went wrong,

238
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,679
and I must return immediately.

239
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,399
Right now?

240
00:12:59,159 --> 00:12:59,919
I took notes

241
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,279
because

242
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:05,919
I have important things

243
00:13:05,919 --> 00:13:06,879
to tell you.

244
00:13:09,639 --> 00:13:10,639
But not right now.

245
00:13:15,799 --> 00:13:16,519
Well...

246
00:13:18,159 --> 00:13:18,960
It's dangerous?

247
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,039
I'll be back soon.

248
00:14:23,559 --> 00:14:24,240
Master Lizhi.

249
00:14:29,039 --> 00:14:30,159
Not good.

250
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:33,919
Not good either.

251
00:14:34,580 --> 00:14:36,352
(The eighth of the fourth month)

252
00:14:38,592 --> 00:14:39,320
(Auspicious for marriage)

253
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:40,279
Auspicious for marriage.

254
00:14:41,639 --> 00:14:44,039
How about the eighth of next month?

255
00:14:48,159 --> 00:14:48,800
What's wrong?

256
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:50,159
What's on your mind?

257
00:14:51,799 --> 00:14:52,440
Nothing.

258
00:14:53,679 --> 00:14:55,600
Until my parents are avenged,

259
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,399
I will have no peace of mind.

260
00:14:58,919 --> 00:14:59,720
And His Majesty...

261
00:15:00,759 --> 00:15:02,360
If he cannot restore order to the court

262
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:03,519
and right these wrongs,

263
00:15:03,799 --> 00:15:04,759
neither we

264
00:15:05,399 --> 00:15:07,000
nor the people of this land

265
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:09,759
will ever live in peace.

266
00:15:18,039 --> 00:15:19,480
You spoke of the new world

267
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:21,360
where women establish themselves;

268
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:23,480
all live with dignity,

269
00:15:24,039 --> 00:15:25,720
never again oppressed by tyranny.

270
00:15:26,639 --> 00:15:27,519
Can you make it real?

271
00:15:28,159 --> 00:15:28,960
Yes, I can.

272
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,000
Swear to heaven then

273
00:15:31,559 --> 00:15:32,240
that you will

274
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:34,159
build a peaceful, prosperous realm.

275
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:35,039
It's a place

276
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:37,480
where no innocent woman

277
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:38,799
is offered as a sacrifice

278
00:15:39,519 --> 00:15:41,399
(and where the nobles
never trample lives.)

279
00:15:42,039 --> 00:15:42,840
(It's a place)

280
00:15:43,519 --> 00:15:44,879
(where she can safely travel)

281
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,399
across the country,

282
00:15:47,159 --> 00:15:48,240
save lives,

283
00:15:49,039 --> 00:15:50,159
and live a peaceful,

284
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:51,960
happy life.

285
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:59,360
I, Zhu Xun, swear

286
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:02,279
I'll build a peaceful, prosperous realm.

287
00:16:02,559 --> 00:16:03,320
A place

288
00:16:03,799 --> 00:16:05,559
where the bad are punished

289
00:16:06,039 --> 00:16:06,840
and where the good

290
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:08,720
can live a peaceful,

291
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,000
happy life.

292
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:10,759
Here and now,

293
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,759
I swear before the true loong:

294
00:16:13,480 --> 00:16:14,759
If I break this vow,

295
00:16:15,519 --> 00:16:16,559
heaven will take me down.

296
00:16:24,692 --> 00:16:29,267
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

297
00:16:30,042 --> 00:16:34,539
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

298
00:16:37,778 --> 00:16:42,900
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

299
00:16:42,900 --> 00:16:46,239
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

300
00:16:46,239 --> 00:16:47,603
♪Refusing to forget♪

301
00:16:51,269 --> 00:16:56,046
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

302
00:16:56,597 --> 00:16:58,387
♪He cannot learn them♪

303
00:16:58,387 --> 00:17:01,522
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

304
00:17:04,674 --> 00:17:06,998
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

305
00:17:06,998 --> 00:17:09,361
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

306
00:17:09,939 --> 00:17:12,603
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

307
00:17:12,603 --> 00:17:14,361
♪Their days ahead are long♪
